WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.670
Check the opportunity status. Only the reference case is available for review; incomplete pipeline cases remain unavailable.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:19.420
Read the headline terms. Asset pool, proposed term and unit reference are clearly marked as illustrative.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.170
Open the detailed review. The full page brings the asset, parties, rights, risks and documents into one journey.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:34.920
Understand what each unit means. Digital units represent approved rights within the structure; they are not the physical asset itself.
